  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TN-Export Development II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project builds upon and anchors more deeply the institutional reforms started under the first Export Development project with the objective of creating a conducive export environbment encouraging trade.  Its development objectives are to improve access to export markets and financecomma and enhance the efficiency trade logistics.  The Project is expected to create linkages between domestic and off-shore sectorscomma enhance competitiveness of private enterprisescomma and strengthen public-private interface to administer and promote internal and external trade.</narrative>
  </description>
